<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman rates Galileo buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman rates Galileo buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of electronics reservations company Galileo International Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $32 a share.</p>
<p>-- the shares rose 11/16 to 26-5/16.</p>
